{"4558280": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Project Rod3nt", "steam_appid": 4558280, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Project Rod3nt is an action-adventure sandbox that mixes cute rod3nts with weapons of mass destruction to create the ultimate time-bending stealth-chaos experience. Play as an array of cybernetic creatures and travel back in time to save the world. We want YOU for Project Rod3nt. Will you step up to join the cause?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4558280/extras/3850b2531f7c6399d77caf50533ab1d8.poster.avif?t=1779247802\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4558280/extras/3850b2531f7c6399d77caf50533ab1d8.webm?t=1779247802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4558280/extras/3850b2531f7c6399d77caf50533ab1d8.mp4?t=1779247802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TIME TRAVEL</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use our next-generation microwave time machine to travel and commit an assassination that will change history forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4558280/extras/543702f4e8cdb7222ed14d8468137614.poster.avif?t=1779247802\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4558280/extras/543702f4e8cdb7222ed14d8468137614.webm?t=1779247802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4558280/extras/543702f4e8cdb7222ed14d8468137614.mp4?t=1779247802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HIDE</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the surrounding environment to stay out of sight, or else… Hiding at the right moment will make or break your success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4558280/extras/10cd6d9841b221fa961a2d101e0755fe.poster.avif?t=1779247802\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4558280/extras/10cd6d9841b221fa961a2d101e0755fe.webm?t=1779247802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4558280/extras/10cd6d9841b221fa961a2d101e0755fe.mp4?t=1779247802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CHAOS</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use guns, grenades, rocks, and more to stun, tip over, and destroy your enemies (Or even yourself if you aren’t careful). Dash between hiding spots and taze any creepy crawlie that dares approach you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4558280/extras/15240f201cf5d212e567cce472156bda.poster.avif?t=1779247802\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4558280/extras/15240f201cf5d212e567cce472156bda.webm?t=1779247802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4558280/extras/15240f201cf5d212e567cce472156bda.mp4?t=1779247802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SWITCH</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between five types of Rod3nts with various unique abilities. Play as a squirrel and glide above obstacles, or try a rat and flatten yourself to become invisible to enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4558280/extras/33560ee107c9e4558bbe7337191b6933.poster.avif?t=1779247802\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4558280/extras/33560ee107c9e4558bbe7337191b6933.webm?t=1779247802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4558280/extras/33560ee107c9e4558bbe7337191b6933.mp4?t=1779247802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>EAT</strong>Survey the environment and sneak around to find sustenance. One tiny piece of cheese is all it takes to fuel a little soldier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4558280/extras/9a38cf091e31ce90a252e352ce48ff12.poster.avif?t=1779247802\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4558280/extras/9a38cf091e31ce90a252e352ce48ff12.webm?t=1779247802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4558280/extras/9a38cf091e31ce90a252e352ce48ff12.mp4?t=1779247802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ASSASSINATE</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kill your target using any means necessary, even nukes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4558280/extras/45b0edd9902c63eac33d778e3903a0d5.poster.avif?t=1779247802\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4558280/extras/45b0edd9902c63eac33d778e3903a0d5.webm?t=1779247802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4558280/extras/45b0edd9902c63eac33d778e3903a0d5.mp4?t=1779247802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SURVIVE</strong><br>Escape the bunker in one piece, or don’t.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4558280/extras/61175af53ce71d45e66f16f0593b80bb.poster.avif?t=1779247802\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4558280/extras/61175af53ce71d45e66f16f0593b80bb.webm?t=1779247802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4558280/extras/61175af53ce71d45e66f16f0593b80bb.mp4?t=1779247802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Project Rod3nt is an action-adventure sandbox that mixes cute rod3nts with weapons of mass destruction to create the ultimate time-bending stealth-chaos experience. Play as an array of cybernetic creatures and travel back in time to save the world. We want YOU for Project Rod3nt. Will you step up to join the cause?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4558280/extras/3850b2531f7c6399d77caf50533ab1d8.